@host = http://localhost:8000

### Create a user (camelCase input works due to aliases)
POST {{host}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "fullName": "Ada Lovelace",
  "age": 36,
  "password": "hunter12"
}

### Bad password (no digit) → 422
POST {{host}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "x@y.com",
  "fullName": "X",
  "age": 25,
  "password": "nodigits"
}

### Date range — invalid (end <= start) → 422
POST {{host}}/date-range
Content-Type: application/json

{"start": "2025-01-02T00:00:00Z", "end": "2025-01-01T00:00:00Z"}

### Order with card payment
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount_cents": 1500, "payment": {"kind": "card", "last4": "4242"}}

### Order with bank payment
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount_cents": 1500, "payment": {"kind": "bank", "iban": "DE89370400440532013000"}}
